  · have hi2mem:i+2 ∈ Finset.range (m+3):=by simp only [Finset.mem_range];omega
    simp [hi2,hi0,hi1,hi2mem,QT,mul_add]
  · simp [hi2,hi0,hi1,QT,mul_add]

