      calc (beta+1)*(H*G2 (Ehi+(beta+1)*t))=(beta+1)*H*G2 (Ehi+(beta+1)*t):=by ring
        _≤(beta+1)*(H-t)*G2 Ehi+(beta+1)*t*G2 (Ehi+(beta+1)*H):=hch
        _=(beta+1)*((H-t)*G2 Ehi+t*G2 (Ehi+(beta+1)*H)):=by ring
    exact Nat.le_of_mul_le_mul_left this hpos

