    FT Ω (AJ Ω C.1) ((suppliedUnit S hp geometry).yzProjection C)=
      BR Ω C.1 (linearU lam):=by
  have hh:=ETQ (suppliedUnit S hp geometry) (DKL S hp geometry) C
  simpa only [DNI,hlam] using hh

