    (C:CM S):
    FT Ω (AJ Ω C.1) ((suppliedUnit S hp geometry).NV C)=
      BR Ω C.1 (linearA mu lam):=by
  have hh:=FKF (suppliedUnit S hp geometry) (DKL S hp geometry) C
  simpa only [DNI,FRR,hlam,hmu] using hh

